1 NOTE When a small child of six years she came with her parents, sisters and brothers to America and resided in Allamakee County, Iowa.  Herman and Belinda were the parents of three children including John who died at the age of five ye
2 CONC ars.  These last fifteen years of her life she made her home with her daughters.   She leaves 11 grandchildren and seventeen great grandchildren.  Five brothers and three sisters have died.  Funeral services were held on Monday, F
2 CONC ebruary 1st at Waterloo Ridge church, Rev. Heltne officiated.
